OL,3,GNEWSACould giant hands hold key to
OL,4,Aunlocking city's railway dreams?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiant hands holding up a railway
OL,7,Fviaduct, enormous horses' heads and
OL,8,Fmassive spinning jenny structures
OL,9,Finspired by a proud industrial
OL,10,Fheritage.
OL,12,FThese are among the unusual design
OL,13,Fideas being championed by Bradford's
OL,14,Fcouncil leader as the city looks to
OL,15,Ftransform its railway infrastructure,
OL,16,Fand perhaps its fortunes.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
