OL,3,GNEWSACould giant hands hold key to
OL,4,Aunlocking city's railway dreams?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStephen Place wants the new station
OL,7,Fdevelopment, planned to replace the
OL,8,Fcurrent 1970s Interchange as part of
OL,9,Fthe broader Northern Powerhouse Rail
OL,10,Fproject, to become an architectural
OL,11,Flandmark that could attract visitors
OL,12,Ffrom around the world.
OL,14,FThe Reform UK politician has suggested
OL,15,Fdrawing inspiration from spectacular
OL,16,Fstructures overseas, including bridges
OL,17,Fsupported by enormous sculpted hands in
OL,18,FChina and Vietnam, as well as the
OL,19,FKelpies horse heads in Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
